
## 🔹 Ansible — Use Jinja2 Template
```yaml
- name: Deploy template for Prasanta Pathnex
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: Copy template file
      template:
        src: pathnex.conf.j2
        dest: /etc/pathnex.conf
```

